%% UC-23 — Export study data (ZIP of CSVs)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Researcher / Admin
    participant AP as Admin Panel
    participant B as Backend (exportService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    R->>AP: Click "Export data" for a study
    AP->>B: GET /api/v1/admin/studies/:id/export
    B->>M: find(srhi_responses, {studyId})
    B->>M: find(daily_behavior_logs) joined via intentions
    B->>M: find(enrollments, {droppedOutAt: {$ne: null}})
    M-->>B: result sets
    B->>B: Build 3 CSVs (SRHI, daily logs, dropouts), bundle as ZIP
    B-->>AP: 200 application/zip (download)
    AP-->>R: Save study-export.zip
